## Key

Red waits on a person, yellow is moving, gray is held by a paused drive, orange cannot move yet or is unproven, green is settled.

| State | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| <span class="drover-needs-operator">needs-operator</span> | Waiting on you. Needs you names the command. |
| <span class="drover-parked">parked</span> | A drive stopped the item. The park reason follows its title. |
| <span class="drover-broken">broken</span> | The item's body does not parse. |
| <span class="drover-running">running</span> | A session is working on it now. |
| <span class="drover-pausing">pausing</span> | Its drive is paused and it is finishing the stage it is in. It holds once that stage ends. |
| <span class="drover-paused">paused</span> | Held by a paused drive before its next stage. Nothing runs until `drover drive --resume`. |
| <span class="drover-running">implemented</span> | Implemented, waiting on its review and pull request. |
| <span class="drover-ready">ready</span> | Every dependency has merged and nothing has run. |
| <span class="drover-blocked">blocked</span> | A dependency has not merged. |
| <span class="drover-scaffold">scaffold</span> | Requirements not written. Write them, then `drover accept`. |
| <span class="drover-done">claimed</span> <span class="drover-done">reviewed</span> <span class="drover-done">verified</span> | Merged, at the audit level recorded: the author's word, a read of the diff, every requirement traced. |
| <span class="drover-unaudited">unaudited</span> | Merged, and nobody has audited it. |
| **follow-up** | An open follow-up nothing is scheduled to carry. |

